=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2. 제 출 처 : 각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">3. 제출내용 : 사진(3 × 4) 1장(사진 뒷면 학번 기재) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">4. 제출기한 : <font color=\"#ff1493\">2009. 4. 17일까지</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">5. 제출방법 : 직접방문 또는 우편</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 주소 : 730-701 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교 대학원지원팀(글로벌관412호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 110.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -110.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 110.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -110.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: rgb(220,20,60); FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">6. 본인 사진 확인 : 원스톱서비스 → 학적 → 학적 및 </span>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 153.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -153.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 각종 자료조회에서 확인.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2009.&nbsp; 4.&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">금오공과대학교 대학(산업,교육)원장<br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
